  "notes": "- 自动选点和连接恢复会参考缓存的地区状态。GeoIP 和 GeoSite 数据过期后可在保持连接时刷新。\n- 支持跨设备同步可移植的设置和自定义规则。导出连接日志时会保留当前筛选条件。\n- 改进桌面端关闭和更新回滚，清除已过期的更新提示。\n",
  "notesEn": "- Node selection and recovery now use cached regional status. YueLink can refresh stale GeoIP and GeoSite data without reconnecting.\n- Portable settings and custom rules can sync across devices. Exporting a filtered connection log now respects the applied filter.\n- Desktop shutdown and update recovery handle more failure cases, and the updater dismisses stale prompts.\n",
